~ start
The Cat: "If you're reading this, that means you're the next person to walk down this valley, right after me."
The Cat: "Don't worry. As you can read, lots and lots of others have walked down it before."
The Cat: "I'm just the latest one. At least right now. And now you're here too."
The Cat: "There is an end. And at the end there is always light."
The Cat: "I'm not sure how long you've been down here... or the number of valleys you've walked down before."
The Cat: "But I do know this. As long as you're down here, fear no evil, and keep going."
The Cat: "You have the best guide and protector with you after all."
The Cat: "I'll see you up ahead :) Much love -C"
=> END